      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "To convert a number from base 5 to base 10, we can express the number as a sum of powers of 5. In this case, we have:\n\n\\[3124_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0\\]\n\nCalculating each term, we get:\n\n\\[3 \\cdot 5^3 = 3 \\cdot 125 = 375\\]\n\\[1 \\cdot 5^2 = 1 \\cdot 25 = 25\\]\n\\[2 \\cdot 5^1 = 2 \\cdot 5 = 10\\]\n\\[4 \\cdot 5^0 = 4 \\cdot 1 = 4\\]\n\nAdding these values together, we get:\n\n\\[375 + 25 + 10 + 4 = 414\\]\n\nSo, \\(3124_5 = 414_{10}\\).\n\nSimilarly, we can convert \\(3122_5\\) and \\(124_5\\) to base 10:\n\n\\[3122_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 2 \\cdot 5^0 = 375 + 25 + 10 + 2 = 412_{10}\\]\n\n\\[124_5 = 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0 = 25 + 10 + 4 = 39_{10}\\]\n\nAdding these base 10 values together, we get:\n\n\\[414 + 412 + 39 = 865\\]\n\nSo, the total dollar amount that the pirate has accumulated is \\(\\boxed{865}\\).",
